### Docker / secrets ###
# Real env files with secrets are never committed — only the .env.example templates are.
# Every .env at any depth is ignored; copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env locally.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!frontend/.env.example

# Private keys / certificates / keystores / credential dumps
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets/
credentials.json

